  "brief": {
    "about": "Jeffrey James's soul guiding, shadow work and men's work practice (River Deep Soul Guiding), serving as an umbrella for The Integrated Man, a men's weekend at Elkstone Farm in Steamboat Springs, CO, co-led with Keith Martin-Smith, Marco Lam and Eddie Konold, plus a resources library (podcasts, clips, talks, worksheets, links).",
    "audience": "Men seeking deeper, more embodied and soulful lives; they should learn about the work, join the Integrated Man interest list, book a free consultation, and use the resources.",
    "feeling": [
      "fire circle",
      "grounded",
      "deep"
    ],
    "notes": "Next Integrated Man dates TBA; interest-list buttons point to jeffreyjames.coach for now. Resource cards marked 'coming soon' are placeholders for Jeffrey's real links. Free address for now; domain later."
